---
import SamlaLayout from '../../layouts/SamlaLayout.astro';
---

<SamlaLayout
  title="Templates | Samla"
  description="Fourteen reference page templates composed entirely from Samla sections, components and patterns."
  current="/templates/"
>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="page-header__inner container">
        <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol>
            <li><a href="/">Samla</a></li>
            <li><a href="/templates/" aria-current="page">Templates</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <p class="page-header__label">Examples</p>
        <h1 class="page-header__title text-page-title">Fourteen pages, no new components.</h1>
        <p class="page-header__lead text-lead">Reference compositions for Fieldwork, a fictional landscape practice. Each page is built only from Samla sections, components and patterns, with static fixture content.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section" data-spacing="none" aria-label="Templates">
      <div class="container">
        <ul class="grid" data-columns="3" role="list">
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/home/">Homepage</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Hero, logo rail, card grid, feature rows, media + content, stats, testimonial, CTA.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/content/">Standard content page</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Page header, article layout with contents, rich text and a data table.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/landing/">Landing page</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Overlay header, media hero, steps, carousel, sticky FAQ, newsletter.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/about/">About</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Story split, values, stats, partners, gallery mosaic.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/services/">Services index</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Bordered service cards, process steps, logo grid.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/service/">Service detail</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Split page header, sticky split, focus areas, related carousel, FAQ.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-studies/">Case studies index</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Listing with client-side filters, count and pagination.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/case-study/">Case study detail</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Project facts, narrative, video, gallery, results, related.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/articles/">Articles index</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Featured article, link filters, sort dropdown, events list, newsletter.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/article/">Article detail</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Author, contents, long-form prose, related articles.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/contact/">Contact</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Validated enquiry form, direct details, studio locations.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/team/">Team</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Profile cards in tabs by studio, careers list, application dialog.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/person/">Person</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Profile pattern, projects led, writing.</p></article></li>
          <li><article class="card"><figure class="card__media media" data-ratio="photo"><div class="media__frame"><img src="https://placehold.co/1200x800/ECEAE4/5C5B57" alt="" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></figure><h2 class="card__title"><a class="card__link" href="/templates/404/">404</a></h2><p class="card__summary">Narrow hero, search and popular links.</p></article></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SamlaLayout>
